        "name": "handshake CLP com MySQL",
        "style": {
            "label": true
        },
        "nodes": [
            "6079ced5985fe492",
            "c65b7e7edcc5d76e",
            "2a210a1f9f8c695c",
            "f2893a7f89623d9e",
            "0abf25f0c3af36c3",
            "4370c361679e26bb",
            "d22c32028906486d",
            "afcb630b6fd8a2e7"
        ],
        "x": 554,
        "y": 259,
        "w": 932,
        "h": 282,
        "info": "Reads DB2 every 500 ms and runs the handshake with the PLC.\r\n\r\nidle  (trigger=0, ready=0, done=0) -> trigger = 1\r\nready (ready=1, done=0)            -> INSERT, then done = 1\r\nreset (ready=0, done=1)            -> trigger = 0, done = 0\r\n\r\nflow.busy avoids inserting the same anvil twice.\r\nOn MySQL error, busy is released and the insert is retried.\r\nTimestamp comes from RD_SYS_T (UTC), read as DTLZ."
    },
